mments":false},"sourcePath":"content/page/about.md","content":"<p>After training in mathematics at Cambridge University, I devolved firstly into a Computer Science Diploma and then\nbranched out into a PhD in Computer Vision at the Engineering Department’s\n<a href=\"https://mi.eng.cam.ac.uk/Main/MiOverview\">Speech, Vision and Robotics group</a>.</p>\n<p>After working in various startups in the Cambridge area I spent a while working at\n<a href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20080706064423/http://www.caret.cam.ac.uk/\">CARET</a>,\nthe Centre for Applied Research in Educational Technologies.</p>\n<p>Following that I spent 5 years as a Visiting Scholar at the\n<a href=\"https://www.colorado.edu/\">University of Colorado at Boulder</a> as a guest of\n<a href=\"https://www.colorado.edu/cs/clayton-lewis\">Clayton Lewis</a>.</p>\n<p>Since then I have been at work on various malleable and community-oriented projects from my base in London, UK.</p>\n","summary":"After training in mathematics at Cambridge University, I devolved firstly into a Computer Science Diploma and then branched out into a PhD in Computer Vision at the Engineering Department’s Speech, Vision and Robotics group . After working in various startups in the Cambridge area I spent a while working at CARET , the Centre for Applied Research in Educational Technologies. Following that I spent 5 years as a Visiting Scholar at the University of Colorado at Boulder as a guest of Clayton Lewis .","summaryText":"After training in mathematics at Cambridge University, I devolved firstly into a Computer Science Diploma and then branched out into a PhD in Computer Vision at the Engineering Department’s Speech, Vision and Robotics group . After working in various startups in the Cambridge area I spent a while working at CARET , the Centre for Applied Research in Educational Technologies. Following that I spent 5 years as a Visiting Scholar at the University of Colorado at Boulder as a guest of Clayton Lewis .","truncated":true}}},"layers":["beautifulWend.document","beautifulWend.document.hljs","beautifulWend.document.selfHosted","beautifulWend.feature.hljs","beautifulWend.feature.selfHosted","beautifulWend.footer","beautifulWend.head","beautifulWend.header","beautifulWend.i18n","beautifulWend.i18n.en","beautifulWend.kind.section","beautifulWend.main","beautifulWend.main.list","beautifulWend.navItem","beautifulWend.navItem.leaf","beautifulWend.navItem.parent","beautifulWend.navbar","beautifulWend.postMeta","beautifulWend.postPreview","beautifulWend.site","fluid.component","fluid.componentList","fluid.listViewComponent","fluid.outputDocumentView","fluid.resolveRoot","fluid.sfcLayer","fluid.sfcTemplateViewComponent","fluid.templateBlock","fluid.templateBlockView","fluid.templateViewComponent","fluid.viewComponent","wend.content","wend.scriptTag","wend.stylesheetTag"]}
